{"ver": "0.1", "info": {"id": "ltl3WH", "date": "1421842393", "viewed": 264, "name": "[2TC 15] Circle Fractal", "username": "yakoudbz", "description": "I just took my \"Circle fractal\" shader and add a little camera mode.\nThere are 86 char left to do something more beautiful :p", "likes": 13, "published": 1, "flags": 0, "usePreview": 0, "tags": ["tweet", "2tc15", "2tc", "15"], "hasliked": 0, "parentid": "", "parentname": ""}, "renderpass": [{"inputs": [], "outputs": [], "code": "// Circles Fractal 2 [2TC 15]\n// By Yakoudbz\n// inpired by https://www.shadertoy.com/view/XllGDH\n//\n// 2 tweet challenge : https://www.shadertoy.com/view/4tl3W8\n\n\n\nvoid mainImage( out vec4 f, in vec2 w )\n{\n    float x = .6 + cos(.7*iTime*.1)*.5;\n    \n    vec2 p = w / iResolution.y - .5*vec2(sin(x*5.),cos(x*11.));\n    \n    for(int i=0; i<10; i++)\n        p = abs(p)/dot(p,p) - x;\n    \n\tf = vec4(p,p.y-p.x,1.);\n}", "name": "Image", "description": "", "type": "image"}]}